sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Streamlit Dashboard
    participant DBM as DBManager.py
    participant DB as Postgres (config)

    Note over U, DB: CRUD Operations for Search Criteria & Global Rules

    alt Create New Search Criteria / Global Rule
        U->>UI: Input parameters (Cities, Filters, Analysis types, Schedule)
        UI->>DBM: save_new_config(data_package)
        rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
            Note right of DBM: Transactional Integrity
            DBM->>DB: INSERT/GET Location IDs
            DBM->>DB: INSERT criteria/rule (RETURNING id)
            DBM->>DB: INSERT into schedule tables (time)
            DBM->>DB: INSERT relations (locations, analysis link tables)
        end
        DB-->>UI: Success (ID returned)
        UI-->>U: Show "Activated" Toast
    
    else Deactivate / Reactivate
        U->>UI: Toggle Active Switch
        UI->>DBM: update_status(id, new_status)
        DBM->>DB: UPDATE table SET is_active = new_status WHERE id = N
        DB-->>UI: OK
        UI-->>U: UI updates (Status Icon change)

    else Soft Delete
        U->>UI: Click Delete
        UI->>DBM: perform_soft_delete(id)
        rect rgb(255, 245, 245)
            DBM->>DB: UPDATE table SET is_active = FALSE, is_soft_deleted = TRUE WHERE id = N
            DBM->>DB: DELETE FROM schedule tables WHERE criteria_id = N
        end
        DB-->>UI: OK
        UI-->>U: Remove from main list
    end